                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Brain and Mind Institute, Aga Khan University",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Email: gloria.chemutai@aku.edu ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "About the Brain and Mind Institute",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The Brain and Mind Institute (BMI) at Aga Khan University operates across East Africa and Central/South Asia with a mission to advance mental and brain health through interdisciplinary research, education, and innovation. Anchored in the principle of moving \"from neuron to neighbourhood,\" BMI connects researchers, clinicians, communities, and policymakers to build robust mental health systems tailored to local needs. Its work focuses on vulnerable populations and prioritizes equitable, culturally informed approaches to neuroscience and mental health.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
