    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Nairobi, Kenya - 26.05.25 -A newly published study by the Aga Khan University's Brain and Mind Institute underscores the critical mental health toll of climate change on vulnerable populations, revealing for the first time robust causal evidence linking climate shocks to depression and suicidal ideation among women in rural Kenya.",
